Comment: 50,0:02:48.02,0:02:48.06,Default,chptr,0,0,0,opsync,OP
Comment: 50,0:04:18.99,0:04:19.03,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part A
Comment: 50,0:13:21.99,0:13:22.03,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part B
