Comment: 50,0:23:52.99,0:23:53.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.79,Alt,Meeter,0,0,0,,Want to give magic a try?{some lines here altered from original translations for context... this one: "Want to give it a try?"}
Dialogue: 50,0:00:21.79,0:00:22.84,Alt,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:22.84,0:00:26.92,Alt,Fuu,0,0,0,,I think it should be magic\Nthat everyone will enjoy!{I think it should be something that everyone will enjoy!}
Dialogue: 50,0:00:27.51,0:00:29.38,Alt,Rui,0,0,0,,They were beautiful.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:33.30,0:00:36.22,Alt,Toko,0,0,0,,I want to be recognized as a great idol by all!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:36.68,0:00:40.23,Alt,Toko,0,0,0,,Once I do that, I know I can change the world!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:40.23,0:00:41.44,Alt,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's get it on!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:43.44,0:00:46.28,Alt,Sena,0,0,0,,Yeah, Toko's a hard one to shake.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:47.19,0:00:48.07,Alt,Rui,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 50,0:00:49.15,0:00:50.70,Alt,Rui,0,0,0,,me?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:51.03,0:00:53.41,Alt,Toko,0,0,0,,Lulu, go out and sing!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:54.83,0:00:58.37,Alt,Rui,0,0,0,,I did it! I was brave!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:59.83,0:01:02.88,Alt,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm Lilly! Nice to meet you too!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:03.42,0:01:04.46,Alt,Rui,0,0,0,,So hot!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:04.46,0:01:05.42,Alt,Sena,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:05.42,0:01:07.05,Alt,Uguisu,0,0,0,,No good! No good!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:05.42,0:01:07.05,Alt,Azuki,0,0,0,,{\an8}What now? What now?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:07.05,0:01:10.05,Alt,Toko,0,0,0,,Summer means sea,\Nand we've got our own private beach!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:10.05,0:01:11.80,Alt,Toko,0,0,0,,It's only natural we swim!{It's only the natural thing to do!}
Dialogue: 50,0:01:13.68,0:01:17.52,Alt,Sena,0,0,0,,Th-There's no way this is just a prank.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:17.52,0:01:20.02,Alt,Rui,0,0,0,,Please help me save everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:20.64,0:01:22.44,Alt,Uguisu,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:22.44,0:01:24.77,Alt,Fuu,0,0,0,,A song me and big sis made together.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:25.98,0:01:29.69,Alt,Fuu,0,0,0,,...Because you really wanted to have it\Nwith the person you love.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:29.69,0:01:32.99,Alt,Rui,0,0,0,,I think you're pretty honest, Lilly-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:33.45,0:01:36.28,Alt,Fuu,0,0,0,,Talking with you really cheered me up.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:36.28,0:01:37.45,Alt,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:37.45,0:01:39.58,Alt,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Nice fresh air!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:39.58,0:01:41.33,Alt,Azuki,0,0,0,,I'm the cat here!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.00,0:01:46.54,Alt,Fuu,0,0,0,,I think everyone wants to see you\Nsinging the way you usually do.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.92,0:01:50.21,Alt,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula palilula!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:52.34,0:01:55.22,Alt,Rui,0,0,0,,Could this be someone's magic?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.49,0:02:12.82,Default,Creature 1,0,0,0,,Lead the materials over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.82,0:02:13.99,Default,Creature 2,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.78,0:02:18.87,Default,Creature 1,0,0,0,,How's the stage coming along?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.87,0:02:20.70,Default,Creature 3,0,0,0,,It's getting there!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.70,0:02:21.75,Default,Creature 1,0,0,0,,Good to hear!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.80,0:02:38.26,Default,Oleans,0,0,0,,The Festival of Magic is almost upon us!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.50,0:04:32.25,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Ready? I'm starting it.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.71,0:04:34.50,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yep, I'm ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.55,0:04:43.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's starting!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.56,0:04:54.48,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Our meeting was no coincidence
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.48,0:04:59.86,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}We're like two stars connected in a constellation
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.07,0:04:58.86,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could you really be Lilly-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.41,0:05:07.45,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm so full.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.64,0:05:31.77,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can Fuu use magic?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.19,0:05:41.45,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Aw, winter break's already over?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.32,0:05:47.37,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I've been studying so hard lately,\NI could use a little breather.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.99,0:05:51.50,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh, weird hearing you say that, big sis.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.50,0:05:56.67,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I know! I'll watch the LuluttoLilly concert\NI was excited for!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.67,0:05:57.46,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.75,0:06:01.22,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Want to watch it with me, Fuu?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.63,0:06:02.80,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Can I?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.76,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you all very much!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.02,0:06:15.27,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Whew, that was fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.44,0:06:23.03,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,By the way, when did you start to like Lilly-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.70,0:06:24.66,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.66,0:06:27.12,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hmm, I can't remember.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.87,0:06:31.37,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Did you see her perform in Shibuya?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.37,0:06:34.37,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I did! You too?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.37,0:06:36.63,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes, on a livestream.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.63,0:06:38.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wow, I didn't know!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.21,0:06:40.88,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,And how about Lulu?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.38,0:06:43.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.97,0:06:46.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I've been her fan since she made her debut.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.55,0:06:49.14,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.51,0:06:53.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan is so mature and super cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.94,0:06:55.48,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.48,0:06:56.60,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.60,0:07:00.23,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,And she's such a hard worker too!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.23,0:07:01.69,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.73,0:07:05.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,She worked so hard on the dance for this concert.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.91,0:07:07.32,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Maybe too hard.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.74,0:07:08.87,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,But that's why.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.66,0:07:13.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I mean, a friend told me that!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.79,0:07:15.33,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You know quite a lot.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.33,0:07:17.00,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.00,0:07:20.09,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hm? That's it.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.09,0:07:21.75,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Just, she's amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.47,0:07:27.64,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Fuu, can you come to the shop?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.64,0:07:28.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.30,0:07:32.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis, I'm happy we watched the concert together!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.31,0:07:34.35,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Talk to you later!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.81,0:07:41.73,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Something's not right.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.57,0:07:47.07,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.66,0:07:52.16,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, Sho-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.70,0:07:53.58,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.58,0:07:55.37,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Oh, morning, Fuu.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.62,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,You look happy.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.62,0:08:01.67,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I am! Yesterday, my big sis and I...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.67,0:08:04.55,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,watched the LuluttoLilly concert online!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.88,0:08:06.26,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.26,0:08:07.09,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.59,0:08:09.34,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,So that's what it was.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.26,0:08:14.77,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You see, big sis has been a lot more chatty lately.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.39,0:08:18.31,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It feels like we're getting along\Nagain like we used to!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.02,0:08:21.81,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,You were getting along badly before?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.19,0:08:26.49,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hmm... I wouldn't say {\i1}badly.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.49,0:08:28.65,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's complicated.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.99,0:08:34.58,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Greetings. Today marks a new semester,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.58,0:08:36.70,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,the last of fifth grade.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.12,0:08:39.96,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,{\an8}So stay on your best behavior\Nand keep working hard.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.62,0:08:39.96,Default,Fuu's Classmate,0,0,0,,What'd you do for the New Year's?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.96,0:08:41.46,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I slept through it.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.75,0:08:44.59,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,Hey, look at this!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.59,0:08:45.63,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.63,0:08:46.46,Default,Rui's Classmate,0,0,0,,Show me!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.97,0:08:49.38,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,Dat-dah!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.38,0:08:51.59,Default,Rui's Classmate,0,0,0,,LuluttoLilly merch?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.59,0:08:54.39,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,That's so cool! Did you buy that?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.39,0:08:57.52,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,I splurged on merch after the concert ended!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.52,0:08:59.06,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,There was so much cute stuff!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.06,0:09:00.60,Default,Mizuka/Classmate,0,0,0,,Aww, lucky!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.60,0:09:04.61,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can tell Fuu was hiding something from me yesterday.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.36,0:09:07.49,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should investigate.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.49,0:09:17.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,She comes down this way\Nfrom elementary school, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.21,0:09:22.46,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Found her!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.46,0:09:27.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Aww, another regular.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.26,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Time to give up?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.26,0:09:32.55,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I gotta get that golden one!\NWhich means...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.47,0:09:35.26,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is she using magic?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.22,0:09:39.27,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'll have to use all my New Year's money!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.35,0:09:46.61,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I got you, golden Kabappy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.61,0:09:48.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.27,0:09:48.53,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}What is that...?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.44,0:09:51.11,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.11,0:09:53.66,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take {\i1}such{\i0} good care of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.24,0:09:57.03,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I think Lilly-san is working today.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.70,0:10:00.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,So she should be going to the agency next!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.38,0:10:07.92,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Wh-What a lovely wall!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.55,0:10:13.84,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Time to go home.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.14,0:10:17.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,That was close...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.03,0:10:37.78,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}This time she's going to use magic!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.96,0:10:44.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Ouch, that's hot!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.71,0:10:48.50,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're going to burn yourself!\NDrink some water.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.88,0:10:50.21,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.26,0:10:54.13,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}She didn't use magic at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.26,0:11:00.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.52,0:11:03.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.02,0:11:06.31,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I brought you some hot milk.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.40,0:11:10.57,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thanks...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.61,0:11:13.15,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.49,0:11:15.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.86,0:11:20.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's cold today, so I was worried\Nyou might freeze if the windows were broken.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.20,0:11:21.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,The windows?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.87,0:11:23.50,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,They're not broken...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.16,0:11:25.37,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.96,0:11:26.83,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Th-That's good.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.13,0:11:29.71,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fuu's room...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.84,0:11:38.43,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a mess.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.09,0:11:40.22,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.47,0:11:43.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.85,0:11:45.60,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Stay warm, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.60,0:11:46.94,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.60,0:11:48.40,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.48,0:11:52.69,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So you were just worried\Nsince it's cold.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.69,0:11:54.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Good night, big sis!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.32,0:12:02.74,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Did I get the wrong idea?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.75,0:12:10.67,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Azuki, you gave me the powers to use magic, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.67,0:12:11.34,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.96,0:12:19.09,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Back then, I saw Lilly-san's performance\Nand wished to be able to sing again too.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.47,0:12:22.10,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,That's right! And what a lovely wish it was.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.47,0:12:24.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Tell me...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.72,0:12:27.23,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,did Fuu get powers too?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.23,0:12:28.23,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.27,0:12:31.86,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Do you know something, Azuki?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.40,0:12:34.86,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Nuh—No–thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.90,0:12:37.40,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.49,0:12:45.95,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Hey, Uguisu!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.70,0:12:50.58,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Wake up! It's an emergency!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.58,0:12:52.17,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,What is it...?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.17,0:12:55.55,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Rui is suspicious of Fuu!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.55,0:12:57.42,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.42,0:13:00.30,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,She might've caught on to her magic!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.59,0:13:04.43,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Oh no! She can't find out!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.47,0:13:08.27,Default,Uguisu/Azuki,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.94,0:13:12.44,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,We have to trick her!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.98,0:13:14.06,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Yes we do!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.06,0:13:15.82,Default,Uguisu/Azuki,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.90,0:13:18.94,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Let's go to sleep.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.94,0:13:21.99,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,So sweepy.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.62,0:13:26.49,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Aight.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.08,0:13:30.00,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,All ready.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.66,0:13:32.67,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Is the new recruit starting today?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.67,0:13:35.54,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yep. Said it just had to be our agency.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.54,0:13:39.21,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Had to be? That's odd.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.55,0:13:42.89,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean, Prez?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.89,0:13:44.43,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.72,0:13:46.93,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Go get her all the gigs you can.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.93,0:13:50.81,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,No can do, I've got games to catch up on.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.81,0:13:54.31,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Ugh, please focus.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.69,0:13:59.53,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,So this is Production Once More...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.86,0:14:03.11,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What'cha doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.24,0:14:06.58,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Um, h-hello!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.16,0:14:10.12,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You're Araki Asahi-chan, correct?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.12,0:14:12.08,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Yep, that's me.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.42,0:14:16.59,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's give it our all today!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.59,0:14:18.21,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I'm cold...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.51,0:14:24.47,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Alright, coast is clear.\NTime to transform.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.05,0:14:27.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Litto!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.65,0:14:43.61,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula palilula!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.24,0:14:48.74,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Pam pam power!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.87,0:15:31.20,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.20,0:15:35.71,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,So Lilly-chan {\i1}does{\i0} love Kabappy!\NJust like her profile says!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.46,0:15:40.71,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I'm actually breathing\Nthe same air as her! My gosh!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.71,0:15:43.67,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,{\an8}I wish I could take this air with me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.71,0:15:43.67,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko, are you sure about this girl?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.67,0:15:47.63,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It might not seem like it,\Nbut I think she's got great potential.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.64,0:15:51.22,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.22,0:15:53.06,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Documents are all clear.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.85,0:15:57.27,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Asahi. Can't wait to work with you.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.27,0:16:00.06,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Sena-sama! I look forward to it too!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.98,0:16:03.28,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Are you already familiar with our agency?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.28,0:16:04.99,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Y-Yes! Very familiar.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.99,0:16:05.94,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.45,0:16:10.24,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Is there anything you want to do here? Any goals?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.24,0:16:13.41,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Anything I want to do? This is sudden...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.83,0:16:16.46,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You want to be an idol, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.54,0:16:22.38,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Don't worry 'bout it.\NIt's a tough question to answer on the spot.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.51,0:16:26.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.22,0:16:28.80,Default,Toko/Sena,0,0,0,,Morning, Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.84,0:16:33.14,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly, allow me to introduce you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.14,0:16:36.68,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This is Araki Asahi-chan. She just joined today!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.68,0:16:38.19,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,A newbie!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.60,0:16:41.19,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm Lilly! Glad to have you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.44,0:16:45.65,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,N-No, th-that's okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.53,0:16:51.11,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,If we shake hands I might die!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.49,0:16:56.08,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,The building's kinda scary and worn-down,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.08,0:16:58.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,but don't worry, everyone here is friendly!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.83,0:17:00.37,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.37,0:17:06.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,And Café Dubdub next door\Nhas the most delicious parfait!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.76,0:17:08.76,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.76,0:17:10.51,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Worn-down building, she says.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.51,0:17:12.51,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,At least it's close to the station.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.89,0:17:16.39,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll be on my way.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.97,0:17:19.60,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,I might have some time,\Nbut I can't idle about.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.60,0:17:20.44,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.81,0:17:24.06,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.06,0:17:27.07,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Hey. We have a new recruit today.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.40,0:17:29.19,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Today, you say?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.03,0:17:31.45,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Um, where's Lilly?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.78,0:17:34.95,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,She's with the rest. I'll leave her to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.95,0:17:36.45,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.08,0:17:41.79,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I haven't seen Lilly-san since the concert.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.33,0:17:49.26,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if Fuu really can transform like me...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.43,0:17:58.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.18,0:18:02.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey, talking about parfaits made me hungry!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.14,0:18:03.85,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We're not getting takeout today.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.85,0:18:04.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.27,0:18:07.65,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sena-san, you're hungry too, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.65,0:18:08.61,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.61,0:18:09.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.36,0:18:12.36,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So can we get magical scones?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.36,0:18:13.36,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Still no!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.36,0:18:15.12,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That's no fair!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.12,0:18:16.41,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,You're all amazing.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.12,0:18:20.41,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Back to the idol question...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.75,0:18:26.08,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I've been watching all of you\Nat Once More for a long time.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.92,0:18:28.67,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,I saw your last concert too.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.88,0:18:34.34,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,It made me feel like I couldn't\Njust sit watching, so I made my move.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.80,0:18:39.39,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Though I wanted to just keep watching you forever.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.60,0:18:42.56,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.98,0:18:46.86,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So we got through to you, Asahi-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.86,0:18:49.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm so happy! This is what we work hard for!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.32,0:18:53.11,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Alright, then!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.11,0:18:56.41,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We've got our own recording of the concert!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.41,0:18:57.41,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Wanna watch?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.08,0:18:59.28,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Yes, absolutely!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.24,0:19:04.00,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,If I see Lilly-san like this...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.00,0:19:05.58,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's do it, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.12,0:19:08.96,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Should I use magic to see for myself?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.84,0:19:12.84,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So excited!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.84,0:19:14.13,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Roll the tape.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.13,0:19:15.55,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.55,0:19:17.76,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila pululila.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.30,0:19:21.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Tell me the secret of the song from back then.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.69,0:19:29.56,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Our meeting was no coincidence
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.56,0:19:36.03,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}We're like two stars connected in a constellation
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.03,0:19:40.99,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}If we happen to connect with one another
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.99,0:19:44.83,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Then we'd know now
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.83,0:19:47.67,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}That it was a miracle
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.67,0:19:50.54,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Let's combine our feelings
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.54,0:19:53.05,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Synchronize our heartbeats
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.05,0:19:59.55,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}And let our imaginations grow even wilder\N(UFO, take us away)
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.55,0:20:02.10,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}If we fall in love (We'll soar into the sky)
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.10,0:20:03.77,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Magical
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.77,0:20:08.73,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Even the dreams I cannot reach
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.73,0:20:13.44,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}So long as you're with me, I can make them happen
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.44,0:20:14.94,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Universe
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.94,0:20:19.61,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Please stay with me, don't leave
Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.61,0:20:22.45,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}We're gentle shooting stars, love
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.45,0:20:26.91,Default,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Taking a rendezvous on a crescent moon
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.90,0:19:36.03,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What on earth?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.49,0:19:39.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.83,0:19:43.29,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Is this the newest tech?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.29,0:19:44.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.50,0:19:54.30,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No, not {\i1}this{\i0} song!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.05,0:19:58.80,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I want to know more about our song\Nfrom my memories!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.91,0:20:20.66,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}"We'll soar into the sky"?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.49,0:20:24.87,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was all that back then...?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.38,0:20:35.01,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What was that just now?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.84,0:20:40.80,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That startled me.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.80,0:20:43.31,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,The new tech is so cool.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.31,0:20:45.35,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What button did I press for that?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.35,0:20:46.89,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, Lulu-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.98,0:20:49.06,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Did you just get here?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.06,0:20:52.90,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes. Good morning.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.90,0:20:55.78,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Right, I gotta introduce you.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.78,0:20:57.40,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This is our new member, Asahi.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.40,0:21:03.49,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,Whew, that was so cool!\NThe greatest concert ever!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.79,0:21:07.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I'm Lulu.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.95,0:21:10.17,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to work with you.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.79,0:21:12.42,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,L-L-Lulu-chan?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.79,0:21:15.71,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,H-Hello! It's my pleasure...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.30,0:21:20.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Glad to have you here!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.59,0:21:22.55,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,My gosh!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.06,0:21:28.35,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,LuluttoLilly is here!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.35,0:21:31.39,Default,Asahi,0,0,0,,The legendary unit is together!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.44,0:21:34.90,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Really, are you sure about her?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.90,0:21:37.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Umm... I think, yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.11,0:21:43.07,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hello, Asahi-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.87,0:21:45.49,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.95,0:21:48.66,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Earth to Asahi-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.34,0:22:07.97,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,In the end, I couldn't figure out\Nwhat that song was about.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.11,0:22:17.94,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,If Lilly-san really is Fuu...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.03,0:22:21.70,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,what should I do?
Comment: 0,0:01:53.55,0:01:58.68,Signs,,0,0,0,,LuluttoLilly
