Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.83,0:22:36.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}So if I make my own decisions{自分で選んだら}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.88,0:22:39.67,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&\an8}All around me will start moving{あれこれの受けて回ります}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.39,0:23:00.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}If you peer into the heart of a passerby{すれ違う人心を覗き込めたら}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.98,0:23:07.74,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Whatever their dream is, it shines like a jewel{どんな夢を見てるキラキラ光って宝石みたいに}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.57,0:23:09.91,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&\an8}Precious heart{大切ハート}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.37,0:23:15.54,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Take the pieces of dreams scattered around the world{世界中散らばる夢の欠片たちをね}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:15.54,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&\an8}Line them all up{全部並べ}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.54,0:23:22.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}And make it come true on three, it'll be amazing{せーので叶えたらAmazing}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.13,0:23:24.55,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Dreams à la mode, for you{どりぃむアラモード For you}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.88,0:23:29.60,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}I'll make our planet into a great big dessert{この星はきっと大きめのデザートに}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.60,0:23:35.85,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}As long as we have hope, we'll be OK{どうして希望ありだけ乗せてOKなの}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.23,0:23:36.90,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&\an8}We'll be OK{なのだよ}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:39.23,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Dreams à la mode, for you{どりぃむアラモード For you}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.23,0:23:43.44,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}I'm sure there's colorful, sweet spells in store{カラフルでスイートな魔法きっとあるはず}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:46.95,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}Try believing it, and tomorrow will be a good day{信じてみてって明日はGood day}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.95,0:23:52.33,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\blur5\3c&HFFFFFF&}La la la, now we're smiling together, see you in the future{La la la笑い合って また未来へ}

